const definitionBody: TextBlockBody[] = [
  'Commercial pressure cleaning is the cleaning of outdoor hard surfaces at a workplace with pressurised water. Car parks, driveways, loading docks, footpaths, entries, bin areas, awnings, render and shopfronts. It removes the grime, algae, moss, oil and chewing gum that build up on any site the public walks across. TLB Cleaning provides commercial pressure cleaning across the Northern Rivers and the Tweed.',
